[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-erasmus-mundus-emimep-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-68":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},68,"erasmus-mundus-emimep-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-68","Erasmus Mundus Emimep Scholarship 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>The Erasmus Mundus EMIMEP Scholarship offers you a unique educational opportunity within the European Union, offering fully-funded scholarships for individuals eager to pursue their studies in Europe.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Erasmus Mundus EMIMEP Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: European Union\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002Fstudy-in-europe\u002F\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: European Union\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€16,800 Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Expenses\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: March 13, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Erasmus Mundus EMIMEP Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Erasmus Mundus EMIMEP Scholarship opens doors to study in esteemed European countries including \u003Cstrong>Germany, Italy, France, and Spain.\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Scholarship caters to postgraduate and master’s level students from all corners of the globe, fostering a diverse and enriching academic environment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Erasmus Mundus EMINEP Scholarship, officially titled the European Master for Industry in Microwave Electronics and Photonics (EMINEP), is a newly funded initiative by the European Union running from September 1, 2023, to October 31, 2029.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Erasmus Mundus EMIMEP Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The recipient of the Erasmus Mundus Scholarship will receive a generous stipend of 16,800 euros per month for the entirety of the program, which spans a maximum of 24 months.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This financial support also extends to covering travel expenses, visa costs, and living allowances, ensuring that scholars can focus wholeheartedly on their academic pursuits.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Erasmus Mundus EMIMEP Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the postgraduate Erasmus Mundus EMIMEP Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold a Bachelor’s degree in relevant fields.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Demonstrate proficiency in areas such as signal processing, electromagnetism, and photonics.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Showcase previous professional or research experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Required Documents for Erasmus Mundus EMIMEP Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 Erasmus Mundus Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Letter of motivation in English – Writing a personal essay to demonstrate the applicant’s motivation and his\u002Fher ability to write clearly and concisely;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Certified copies of High-School\u002FSecondary school certificate;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Certified copies of bachelor’s degree and transcripts until the application date;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Copy of passport or ID.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CV;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Self-declaration of honours about the proof of residence\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Test report or certificate of English language proficiency.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Three reference letters, one of them from a non-academic referee attesting to basic competencies and practical experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The reference letters shall include any proof of recognition of the referee (LinkedIn ID, Google scholars ID or any proof online).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proofs of employment (employment certificate\u002F internships) of the last 5 years by the deadline of the student scholarship application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.erasmus-mundus.emimep.eu\u002Fadmission-applications\u002Fhttps-www-erasmus-mundus-emimep-eu-admission-applications-erasmus-mundus-application\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.erasmus-mundus.emimep.eu\u002Fadmission-applications\u002Fhttps-www-erasmus-mundus-emimep-eu-admission-applications-erasmus-mundus-application\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-11 10:13:46",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ferasmus-mundus-emimep-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69b1324ab3f7b0.61224967_screenshot 2026-03-11 100815.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ferasmus-mundus-emimep-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69b1324ab3f7b0.61224967_screenshot%202026-03-11%20100815.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":